[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22500100_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22500100_02_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22500100_02_0010","text":"──怎么样？\n制作人。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22500100_02_0020","text":"录音"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22500100_02_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22500100_02_0030","text":"啊，当然感觉很好。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22500100_02_0040","text":"虽然现在说可能有点多余，\n但美琴你唱歌果然很厉害啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22500100_02_0050","text":"是吗？\n那就好。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22500100_02_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22500100_02_0060","text":"不过这首歌……\n因为是SHHis的第一首曲子，"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22500100_02_0070","text":"可能有点太用力了。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22500100_02_0080","text":"哈哈，是吗。\n那就得再放松一点才行啊。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22500100_02_0090","text":"……嗯。\n休息完之后，我觉得能唱好。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22500100_02_0100","text":"听好了，制作人。"}]
